# Hello, world! in Unlambda: langlib original.
#
# A chain of printing functions, applied left to right. `.H.e prints H
# and returns .e, which is then applied to .l, and so on; r prints the
# newline and returns i, which ends the chain by doing nothing at all.
``````````````.H.e.l.l.o.,. .w.o.r.l.d.!ri
